      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Rhinedottir: Rhinedottir in Snezhnaya",
      "content": "She entered Snezhnograd's Northland Bank vault after a failed experiment was discovered, returned all Seals of Life, and took back Naberius' stolen power from Vesna. A week later she went to Zapolyarny Palace to trade information with the Tsaritsa and was caught in the Tsaritsa's time-slowing field. She missed the resurrection window agreed with Ronova, Celestia reclaimed Ronova's authority and directed Rhinedottir to resurrect the dead, and she spared the Tsaritsa.",
